      "",
      "OPEN: contracts keep the canonical term meanwhile. RESOLVED: outcome names the winner and the loser's fate.",
      "",
      "| outcome | what happens |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| canonical holds | disputed word becomes a forbidden synonym; RESOLVED |",
