      "# philosophy: entoolment is the pinnacle",
      "",
      "**tool** is the umbrella: 📚 brief, 💧 fluid, 🔩 rigid, 🪨 solid skill. all are pavement; they differ in imagine cost per use. \`skill\` is the word a brief is contrasted against, never \`tool\`.",
