    "lines": [
      "# rule.always.concede-with-a-severity",
      "",
      "> **when you concede a concern, grade it \`better\` or \`urgent\`. \`--severity\` is REQUIRED. \`better\` never earns budget; \`urgent\` is the only concession that earns more.**",
      "",
      "\`\`\`sh",
      "rhx route.stone.set --stone <stone> --as conceded --with <reviewer> --about <concern> --severity better|urgent",
      "\`\`\`",
      "",
      "urgent = security · safety · monetary · reputation · behavioral. code idealism is never urgent.",
      "",
      "test: **name the harm that ships if this is not fixed now.** can → \`urgent\` · cannot → \`better\`.",
      "",
      "| when… | then… |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| you reach for \`urgent\` to buy a round | name the harm first; none → \`better\` |",
      "| a \`better\` concession tempts a budget ask | forbidden; spend the floor |",
      "| concern correct but cosmetic | \`better\` (correctness is not harm) |",
      "| budget hit, every concession \`better\` | good enough: proceed, no human |",
      "| an urgent concession sat on the last round | you warn your human: write why this stone bought budget (no engine sends it) |",
      "",
      "blocker: a \`better\` concession that earns budget · an \`urgent\` grade with no nameable harm · a budget hit with no urgent concession that summons a human.",
    ],
