      "| already halted and a different gate clears | halt stands; re-probe only the gate that raised it |",
      "| its own gate has cleared | now re-arrive |",
      "| structural objection, an itemized fulcrum reserves the call | no \`.taken\`: halt, hand up objection + fulcrum row |",
      "",
      "dark lanes: remedy is a guard edit (\`--paths-with\`, \`--conversation\`), never a hand-run \`rhx review\`. a commit quota alone is no legit \`--as blocked\`: the stone must ASK for a commit (\`rule.forbid.commits-the-route-did-not-ask-for\`).",
