      "# rule.require.catalog-is-an-index",
      "",
      "a catalog is an index: one row per member, no narrative about any one. it takes the itemization form (\`catalog.of=$concept._.md\` plus \`$dimension=$position.md\` per member).",
      "",
      "## .three grains",
      "",
      "| artifact | grain | holds |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| catalog | the set | one row per member: pattern, rule, detect question |",
      "| rule | the class | mechanism, detect question, ONE worked case, fix, enforcement |",
