      "",
      "## .the test, before a paragraph lands",
      "",
      "is this about the class (→ rule), the set (→ catalog), or one occurrence (→ \`example=$id.md\`)? prose about the set (classification, through-line, named gap) is what a catalog is for. prose about one member is the violation.",
