    "lines": [
      "# rule.require.rules-are-clusters",
      "",
      "a rule is a cluster, not a file that accretes.",
      "",
      "\`\`\`",
      "rule.forbid.$topic.md                 # the CLASS — lean entry point",
      "rule.forbid.$topic.example=$id.md     # ONE file per occurrence — opt-in",
      "\`\`\`",
      "",
      "the rule keeps exactly one worked case, the sharpest. every other occurrence, and the full record of the worked one (sweep, injections, residual), goes to an example file beside it.",
      "",
      "one file per occurrence; the id in the filename is the citation:",
      "",
      "\`\`\`",
      "👍  rule.forbid.$topic.example=R9-U1.md",
      "👎  rule.forbid.$topic.example=occurrences.md",
      "\`\`\`",
      "",
